\item \href{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2311.08042}{Gaspers and Li, \emph{Quantum Algorithms for Graph Coloring and Other Partitioning, Covering, and Packing Problems} (ICALP 2024)}. Theorems 4--6 and Corollary 1: general covering framework and refined bounds.
